UPSTREAM TERMS
--------------
These files are sampled and relabelled subsets of two existing corpora. The
original terms of those corpora continue to apply alongside this licence, and
they must be cited in any work that uses this data:

  deptweet_main.csv
    Derived from DepTweet.
    Kabir et al. (2023), "DEPTWEET: A typology for social media texts to
    detect depression severities", Computers in Human Behavior.

  irony_main.csv
    Derived from the SemEval-2018 Task 3 irony detection corpus.
    Van Hee et al. (2018), "SemEval-2018 Task 3: Irony Detection in English
    Tweets", Proceedings of SemEval-2018.

Tweet text is redistributed here for research reproducibility. Anyone
redistributing it further should check the current terms of the upstream
datasets and of the X/Twitter developer policy.
